      "text": "Peds dosing (viscous lidocaine label):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " > 3 y w norm lean body mass and development: max dose set by wt or age, eg, a 5-y-old weighing 50 lb → ≤ 75–100 mg (3.7–5 mL); infants and < 3 y: measure accurately, ≤ 1.2 mL applied to the area w a cotton-tipped applicator; wait ≥ 3 h b/n doses; max four doses in 12 h."
     }
